If you're a wizard or spellcaster, a spellbook of detect treasure will
do you good, as the PYEC only adds a single charge with each
invocation for non-tourists. If you're a rogue, it's trivial to get
tons of potions of object detection using monster generation on the
Quest. Otherwise, if you have a ton of crap scrolls, you could
polypile for scrolls of gold detection. You'll likely get some other
nice scrolls in the process.

Finally, you could ask Rodney nicely. I believe covetous monsters
prioritize snatching the unique items over killing you, so you could
wait for Rodney to spawn at the top of Gehennom and dig downwards with
the wizard in tow. If the wizard teleports away, he's getting the bell
for you! You're out of luck if the bell's underwater, but this is very
unlikely as a covetous monster would steal your quest artifact or the
Candelabrum before stealing the bell.

NOTE: you should wizmode-test this first. I unfortunately don't have
access to wizmode right now.


